      "type": "edit",
      "id": "21eb5354d2adb29e",
      "item": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "id": "21eb5354d2adb29e",
        "text": "**Version:** 0.12.0\n\n# Links\n\n- [https://github.com/Hitchhikers-Guide-to-the-Galaxy/wiki-plugin-similarity GitHub repository]\n- [https://www.npmjs.com/package/wiki-plugin-similarity npm package]\n- [https://plugin.fedwiki.club/similarity-plugin.html Plugin documentation]\n- [https://search.fedwiki.club/ Search hub] \u2014 architecture, indexing, freshness."
      },
      "date": 1785397304700
