        "type": "markdown",
        "id": "df7785a66e945d29",
        "text": "0.20.0 reads the **Semantic Site Graveyard**. [https://dead.fedwiki.club/view/welcome-visitors dead.fedwiki.club] is a wiki Marvin writes nightly from the galaxy registry's probe record: one page per site that is not solid, its first sentence the verdict \u2014 dead, moved, lapsed, unreliable or flaky, and where a moved site went. That makes the wiki's own `sitemap.json` a feed, and the plugin fetches it daily (conditional GET, `similarity.json` `verdicts` to point elsewhere or switch it off, `WIKI_VERDICTS` likewise). `site-rank` then drops dead and lapsed sites from every batch, searches a moved site's destination in its place, and sinks unreliable and flaky sites by `WEIGHT reliable` (default 0.3); the Search Algorithm page gains that weight and `TRUST solid|flaky|any`. `similarity-health.json` reports the feed and how many verdicts it holds. The plan is the [https://plan.ide.earth/view/dead-sites-plan Dead Sites Plan]."
      },
